BrowserNotificationRepository ..> BrowserDatabase : usa
Notifications ..> NotificationService : usa
Notifications ..> ReservationService : usa
Notifications ..> OfferService : usa
Notifications ..> BusinessService : usa
OfferService ..> OfferRepository : usa
OfferService ..> BusinessService : usa
OfferService ..> SessionService : usa
OfferService ..> BrowserDatabase : usa
OfferService ..> ClockService : usa
OfferRepository <|-- BrowserOfferRepository
BrowserOfferRepository ..> BrowserDatabase : usa
Catalog ..> OfferService : usa
Catalog ..> BusinessService : usa
Catalog ..> GeolocationService : usa
OfferCard ..> BrowserImageStorage : usa
OfferCard ..> BusinessService : usa
OfferCard ..> GeolocationService : usa
ManageOffers ..> OfferService : usa
OfferDetail ..> BrowserImageStorage : usa
OfferDetail ..> OfferService : usa
OfferDetail ..> BusinessService : usa
OfferDetail ..> SessionService : usa
OfferDetail ..> ReservationService : usa
OfferEditor ..> OfferService : usa
OfferEditor ..> BusinessService : usa
OfferEditor ..> BrowserImageStorage : usa
